  "slug": "buffys-refried-beans",
  "name": "Buffy's Refried Beans",
  "recipe_type": "side",
  "brief_description": "These smooth and creamy beans make a tasty side for any Mexican dish.",
  "cuisine": "Mexican Inspired American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Melt the lard in a deep, heavy pot over medium-high heat; when the lard is hot, add the beans. Stir constantly while cooking until the beans reach a paste-like consistency. Season with salt. Reduce heat to low and stir in the water. Simmer and stir until the beans cook down to your desired consistency."
    }
